#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594232"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594336"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594472"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594516"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594656"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594776"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594876"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595068"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595132"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595212"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595328"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595456"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595500"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595628"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595756"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595864"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595952"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596044"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596192"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596276"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596408"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596508"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596668"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596796"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596888"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597020"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597120"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597328"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597452"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597584"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597676"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597800"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597880"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597984"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598072"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "598192"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "598276"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "598356"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "598424"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "598464"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "598496"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598528"
msgid "*kgh*, how far does this path stretch on for!?\nWe'll be swept up in the reinitialization\nat this pace!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598632"
msgid "This isn't infinite, but there's no end\nin sight…! We'll get caught in the\nreinitialization at this rate!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598740"
msgid "Oh no, the same logic as Izumo Shrine's path!\nCrap, if humans are forbidden on them\nthen if it catches us, we'll be reset―!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598868"
msgid "Gah. Even moving at cognitive speeds, there's no\nend in sight! I never foresaw such structure to\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…! I WILL NOT be reinitialized!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599028"
msgid "This    abstract barrier    is\n404 light years    in length."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599092"
msgid "Gah, will #C236196003Sakura#CDEF shorten this path in time,\nor will we be caught by the reinitialization――\nThis won't prove easy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599224"
msgid "404 years AT the speed of light!?\nI almost fainted hearing that!\nThere goes our chit-chat time!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599320"
msgid "My fangs have dulled if I'm relying on women in\ndire straights now! I'll watch my health next\ntime I slumber, okay! So keep moving!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599452"
msgid "I see it, Praetor!\nThe edge of this region―――\nIt's the barrier leading to the Near Side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599544"
msgid "I see it…!\nThat's the end of this region, the border\nbetween this place and the Near Side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599636"
msgid "Alright! Now I see it! That's the barrier\nbetween higher and lower dimensions!\nBasically, a gate to the third dimension!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599760"
msgid "Stand aside, I knew it would come to this!\nI came along with you for a good reason!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599844"
msgid "Stand back, I'll tear it down!\nBut… it may come down to the wire!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599912"
msgid "Please stand back, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nThis barrier was never designed to open―\nso we have no other recourse than force!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600048"
msgid "We'll force through, that's a given…! Castle\ngates have keys, but walls must simply be torn\ndown. Step back, I don't plan on aiming!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600184"
msgid "Sparks fly from #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's strikes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600232"
msgid "It causes the barrier, this \"edge of the world,\"\nto crack slightly.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF continues the unrelenting #SVT[blade][blade][magic][blade]# wallop.\nA little more of this might break the barrier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600436"
msgid "*kgh*…!\nI just need a few more seconds!\nWill I fall short!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600500"
msgid "Guh, this is one tough nut to crack…!\nI may just fail by mere seconds…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600576"
msgid "―――Hmph. I can manage on my own,\nbut there may only be a fraction\nof a second left over…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600672"
msgid "Yes, yes, I know.\nI'll let you have your spotlight.\nEven I can be a considerate man now and then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600772"
msgid "He continues to rend the barrier with unshaking composure,\nfully believing that someone has his back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600876"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF wrings out #SVT[her][his][her][his]# very soul with each rending blow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600968"
msgid "But we're out of time.\nThe reinitializing wave looms―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601028"
msgid "Sheesh―――This is just pathetic, White.\nDon't tell me you need to overclock over\na little shortcut."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601132"
msgid "Thank goodness, she's alive as well…!\nAnd she's stopped the reinitializing wave for us…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601224"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's body is being disassembled by the red wave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601292"
msgid "She'll end up vanishing into the crimson.\nWanting to pull her to safety, I, I try―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601380"
msgid "B-but I can't get close!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601408"
msgid "The black barrier #C236196003BB#CDEF put up isn't just holding\nback the reinitializing wave; it's also stopping\nme from going back for her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601548"
msgid "I didn't want to, honestly, but I'll put up with\nit if it's to help you. What would have been the\npoint if I just let you come back for me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601688"
msgid "―――Protecting #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF all alone\nhad been whittling away at her body.\nThis entire time. Now she's about to disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601832"
msgid "I know that when she took over the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nshe was fully aware that it would break her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601940"
msgid "I mean, I don't understand.\nI never asked her to do all that for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602012"
msgid "Ah, of course you wouldn't understand. You never\ndid anything that major for me, Senpai. \nYou're pretty much a stick-in-the-mud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602144"
msgid "Yeah, but still―――I was happy about that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602192"
msgid "She must be referring to the old days back in the Infirmary.\nAll we did was spend the days chatting,\nyet that was enough for her to make an\nenemy of the entire world―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602364"
msgid "Ugh, my time is up. *sigh*, I look so lame.\nNow I don't have the right to laugh at White."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602456"
msgid "I only lasted, a few minutes? Seriously?\nHey, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF. Please hurry and get\nthat happy #[guy][girl]# out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602584"
msgid "I only lasted, a few minutes? Seriously?\nHey, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF. Please hurry and get\nthat happy #[guy][girl]# out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602712"
msgid "I only lasted, a few minutes? Seriously?\nHey, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF. Please hurry and get\nthat happy #[guy][girl]# out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602840"
msgid "I only lasted, a few minutes? Seriously?\nHey, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF. Please hurry and get\nthat happy #[guy][girl]# out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602968"
msgid "Go somewhere far, far away. Far out of my\nreach. Far enough that any attachments or\ndreams fall out of sight…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603080"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF―――!\nMhm, consider it done!\nI won't fail. This is the end!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603160"
msgid "Ah… you two used to be one person. I'm grateful\nfor your determination. I'll get #[this guy][her]#\nback in one piece, even if it costs me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603300"
msgid "You needn't tell me twice. That said――\nI believe you've won this round. You showed\nyour womanly side at the very, very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603428"
msgid "――Consider your request heard. Oh #RUBSButterfly#RUBEVermin#REND of\nthe Moon, emerging in your last only to fade. \nExhaust your all, and fade without regrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603592"
msgid "The red wave engulfs #C236196003BB#CDEF's black light.\nBehind me, I hear the barrier cracking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603688"
msgid "At this point, even if I were to reach out or run to her,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is too far―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603784"
msgid "Goodbye.\nMaybe―――we'll see each other again today.\nThose old days were so much fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603872"
msgid "Ah, that's right.\nThere's one last thing I almost forgot\nto mention."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603944"
msgid "It's about why I was against having\nyou come rescue me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604000"
msgid "I didn't want you to see me looking lame\nin my final moment, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604072"
msgid "She's disappearing.\nThe red wave is engulfing #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604140"
msgid "My fingers don't reach.\nThere's no reclaiming our time together now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604212"
msgid "―――I couldn't save her, not even once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604256"
msgid "#C080080080I call out #CDEF#C236196003BB#CDEF#C080080080's name.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604328"
msgid "#C080080080My outstretched hand grazes against her tattered black coat.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604408"
msgid "#C080080080―――Suddenly,\n      I witness a time-crossed vision.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604480"
msgid "That was her name when I would visit and chat with her\ntime and time again in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604576"
msgid "―――Yeah. Farewell, Senpai.\nI really want you to know, I love you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604648"
msgid "Everything behind us is gone.\nMy personal path is crumbling, but it's still holding together.\nI'm pressing onward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604764"
msgid "Hrm. It looks like this path leads to the\nNear Side. The Far Side has already\nfinished reinitializing…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604868"
msgid "Praetor. It seems you'll have to dash straight\nto the Near Side to make it out alive.\nThe only problem is this barrier―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604996"
msgid "Fret not, we'll figure something out!\nCharge, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!\nYour triumphant return is nigh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605108"
msgid "This path goes straight to the Near Side…\nLooks like the Far Side is done reinitializing.\nThen the old school building is gone…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605240"
msgid "You'll have to return to your original timeline\nback in the Near Side if you want to make it out\nalive. Only issue is how to get through――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605384"
msgid "Run, Master!\nHere's our final struggle for survival!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605440"
msgid "Sniff-sniff.\nOh! This path connects to the Near Side.\nGreat job, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605532"
msgid "Take this, and we're home free.\nWe'll be able to give this place a\nsayonara―just one little problem though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605644"
msgid "…well, we'll deal with it some way or another!\nCome, Darling, hurry up! This is where I\nshow you what I'm REALLY made of!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605768"
msgid "Well, well. That #C236196003Sakura#CDEF girl sure has finesse.\nThis path leads directly to the Near Side.\nTake it, and you'll return to your timeline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605920"
msgid "But the situation is urgent. We'll have to\nbound across this path before we get\ncaught in the Core's reinitialization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606040"
msgid "Nary a moment to breathe, but what better a\nbackdrop to conclude on? Rush forward, Master!\nWe're taking our leave from the underworld!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "606176"
msgid "Beyond this point, there is no return."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "606216"
msgid "you save in a different location."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606252"
msgid "The tatters of her black coat evaporate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606296"
msgid "―――Such was the vision I had glimpsed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606340"
msgid "The passage is ready!\nHurry, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606380"
msgid "The barrier is down!\nHurry, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606416"
msgid "Please make haste!\nNow we just need to get you out\nof here, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606488"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF takes me by the hand, and we stand\nbefore the white barrier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606572"
msgid "Is there―――an opening somewhere?\nBefore I can check for one, I get pushed from behind―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606668"
msgid "Next up is my part. The barrier has opened.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, close your eyes for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606768"
msgid "#C080080080My vision blanks white before\nI can even do as #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF#C080080080 says.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606876"
msgid "#C080080080The world gets painted over with blinding light.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606944"
msgid "\n#C080080080After the impact wears off, I cautiously open my eyes―――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

